{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本福島縣被大雪所困的民眾，孤立狀態解除。</p><p></p><p>福島縣裡磐梯地區，周末因大雪令樹木倒塌阻塞公路，900多名居民以及約500名旅客被困，直至周日晚，縣當局完成清理工作後，孤立狀態被解除。</p><p></p><p>民眾被困約30小時期間，當局曾出動直升機，運送食物和飲用水到該區。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T22:22:23.974848+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T11:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T22:30:09.269251+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T22:15:37.182830+00:00","content_hash":"921b1de57b08cb4352696fc652a0d115960ab3a4ac4e878c432ad90e1bf0709a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T22:22:23.974848+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}